are one condition rather than two that can drift.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"age_ms\",\"description\":\"How old the newest reading is, so a caller can render 'N minutes ago' without re-deriving it. Null when there is no reading.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"priced_point_count\",\"description\":\"How many points carried a price. A gap from point_count is how a window with unpriceable blocks announces itself.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"latest\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"TaoUsdLatest\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"oldest_observed_at\",\"description\":\"How far back the answer actually reaches -- the series began 2026-08-02.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"change_usd\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"change_pct\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"points\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"LIST\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"TaoUsdPoint\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}}}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"TaoUsdLatest\",\"description\":\"The newest reading with the derivation that produced it, kept together so both describe the same block.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"usd_per_tao\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"price_basis\",\"description\":\"Stated even when the price is null -- it is what says why.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"eth_usd\",\"description\":\"The ETH/USDC anchor leg the composition multiplied through.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"block_number\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"observed_at\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"pool_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"pools\",\"description\":\"Per-pool provenance as the producer stored it.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"LIST\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"JSON\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}}}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"TaoUsdPoint\",\"description\":\"One TAO/USD reading.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"observed_at\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"block_number\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"usd_per_tao\",\"description\":\"Null means the block was not priceable (insufficient pool quorum), NOT a zero price.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetSurfaceHistory\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"schema_version\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"netuid\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"limit\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"change_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"surface_count\",\"description\":\"Distinct surfaces with a recorded mutation -- NOT the subnet's current surface count. A deleted surface is counted here and absent there.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"latest_change_at\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"changes\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"LIST\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"SurfaceHistoryChange\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}}}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SurfaceHistoryChange\",\"description\":\"One recorded mutation of a subnet's public surface.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"surface_id\",\"description\":\"Coalesced column then overlay id, so it is present on every row including those written before the column was recorded.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"action\",\"description\":\"insert, update or delete. A delete is the only evidence a surface ever existed.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"kind\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"url\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"name\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"source_commit\",\"description\":\"The registry commit that produced the change.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"recorded_at\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetConcentrationHistory\",\"description\":\"Per-subnet per-day concentration trend (#5901) from the neuron_daily rollup, newest first. An empty series (point_count 0) on a cold store, never a GraphQL error. Mirrors GET /api/v1/subnets/{netuid}/concentration/history.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"schema_version\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"netuid\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"window\",\"description\":\"The resolved window label (7d/30d/90d).\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"point_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"points\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"LIST\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"SubnetConcentrationHistoryPoint\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}}}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetConcentrationHistoryPoint\",\"description\":