lues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"DeregistrationDerivation\",\"description\":\"How a deregistration feed was derived (#9307). NeuronDeregistered has never been emitted, so deregistrations are derived from UID reuse: a NeuronRegistered on a (netuid, uid) slot already held by a different hotkey IS the deregistration of the previous occupant. unattributed_registrations is the honest part -- the published totals are a LOWER BOUND by that many events, because those registrations displaced a holder the derivation's lookback cannot name.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"method\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"lookback_days\",\"description\":\"Days of NeuronRegistered history the derivation had available.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"window_registrations\",\"description\":\"Registrations observed inside the reported window.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"unattributed_registrations\",\"description\":\"Of those, the ones with no observed previous holder.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"is_lower_bound\",\"description\":\"True when the count is a floor rather than a measurement: some registrations in the window displaced a holder the derivation's lookback cannot name, so the real figure is higher by at least `unattributed_registrations`. Treat the value as 'at least this many', never as a total.\",\"args\