se,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"registered_at_block\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"is_immunity_period\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Boolean\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"axon\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"axon_routable\",\"description\":\"Whether `axon` points somewhere on the public internet; null when there is no axon. Carried wherever `axon` is, because an unqualified endpoint implies reachability it may not have -- 5.3% of announced axons network-wide sit in RFC 5737, RFC 1918, loopback or 0.0.0.0/8 (#11373). Normally null here: not serving is the usual state for a validator.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Boolean\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"take\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetOhlc\",\"description\":\"One subnet's alpha-price OHLC candles (#6979). Mirrors GET /api/v1/subnets/{netuid}/ohlc' data envelope.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"schema_version\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"netuid\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"interval\",\"description\":\"The resolved bucket interval (1h/1d).\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"candles\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"LIST\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"SubnetOhlcCandle\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}}}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"candle_count\",\"description\":\"How many candles the WINDOW holds, not how many this page carries. A `limit` narrows `candles` from the recent end; this stays the denominator, the same convention /chain/deregistrations uses for its own page. A FLOOR rather than a total when `window_truncated` is true, and NULL when the series could not be read at all -- see `degraded`.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"window_truncated\",\"description\":\"True when the window holds MORE candles than one read can carry, so `candle_count` is a floor rather than the total. The exact total is not published because it is not obtainable at this tier's cost: the aggregate that would count it is rejected as `scan budget exceeded` on any window wide enough to need it.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Boolean\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"root_excluded\",\"description\":\"True for root (netuid 0), whose 1:1 price makes candles meaningless, so none are emitted.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Boolean\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"degraded\",\"description\":\"Present ONLY on a decline. An empty `candles` WITHOUT this block is a measurement -- either a genuinely untraded window, or root. With it, `candle_count` is null and nothing about the series is known.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"UnavailableDegraded\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"usd_available_from\",\"description\":\"Bucket start of the OLDEST candle carrying USD, or null when none does. Published rather than left to be inferred from where the nulls stop, so a caller can render 'USD from <date>' instead of a series that silently changes meaning partway along.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"usd_available_from_iso\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"priced_candle_count\",\"description\":\"How many candles carry USD. A gap against candle_count is the TAO series outrunning the TAO/USD index, not a defect.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"usd_unavailable\",\"description\":\"Why NO candle could be priced, or null. `index_unpriced` is ADR 0025's insufficient_pools -- a stated decline, never a price of zero; `read_failed` means the index could not be queried at all, which is not a claim about the index. A partially-priced series leaves this null and explains itself through usd_available_from.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"field_sources_usd\",\"description\":\"Every _usd field is RECONSTRUCTED -- the product of a measured alpha price and a measured TAO/USD index, which is our arithmetic and not a chain read.\",\"args\":[]