 (~20 tempos/day) on effectively every subnet -- not one day: multiply by tempos/day before deriving a daily figure.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"yield\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"vs_median\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetYieldHistory\",\"description\":\"Per-day emission-yield distribution trend for one subnet (newest first) over a 7d/30d/90d window: the subnet-wide return plus the mean/median/p25/p75/p90 of the per-UID emission-per-stake yields. The return-rate twin of /concentration/history and the time-series companion to the /yield snapshot — the per-UID yield distribution (median/percentiles) is not reconstructable from the stake+emission totals in /history. Computed live from the neuron_daily rollup.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"schema_version\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"netuid\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"window\",\"description\":\"The resolved window label (7d/30d/90d).\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"point_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"points\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"LIST\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"SubnetYieldHistoryPoint\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}}}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetYieldHistoryPoint\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"snapshot_date\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"neuron_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"validator_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"yield_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"subnet_yield\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"mean_yield\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"median_yield\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"p25_yield\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"p75_yield\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"p90_yield\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetEmissionSplitHistory\",\"description\":\"Per-day split of one subnet's emission by recipient class — owner, validators, miners — over a 7d/30d/90d window, newest first. The validator/miner split is MEASURED from the per-UID neuron_daily rollup; the owner leg and every absolute figure are RECONSTRUCTED, because the owner's cut is paid outside the UID set and `SubnetOwnerCut` is unset on chain. A subnet with no daily rollup resolves to a schema-stable empty series (point_count 0), never null. Mirrors GET /api/v1/subnets/{netuid}/emission-split/history.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"schema_version\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"netuid\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"window\",\"description\":\"The resolved window label (7d/30d/90d).\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"point_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"points\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"LIST\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"SubnetEmissionSplitHistoryPoint\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}}}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"miner_earnings\",\"description\":\"THE MINER INCOME DISTRIBUTION (#11096): what a miner here actually makes, per day, at p50/p75/p90 and the top earner, in alpha and USD -- shares measured from the window's per-UID emission (burn sink excluded), priced through the newest point's own legs. Null when the window holds no miner UIDs.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetEmissionSplitMinerEarnings\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"field_sources\",\"description\":\"Per-field { kind, storage } provenance map: every value is labelled measured (with the pallet-qualified storage item it was read from) or reconstructed (our arithmetic over measurements, storage null). ADR 0023 decision 5.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"JSON\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetEmissionSplitHistoryPoint\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"snapshot_date\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"neuron_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"validator_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"miner_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"earning_validator_count\",\"description\":\"Validator-permit UIDs that recorded emission above zero on this day.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"earning_miner_count\",\"description\":\"Non-validator UIDs that recorded emission above zero on this day. Against `miner_count` this is how many registered miners earned anything at all — the median subnet has almost none, and a miner count read alone overstates participation.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"validator_alpha\",\"description\":\"Emission to validator-permit UIDs. ALPHA-denominated for every non-root subnet — safe to compare within one subnet, never across subnets without the price join.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"miner_alpha\",\"description\":\"Emission to non-validator UIDs, alpha-denominated -- the BURN SINK excluded (#11094): the SubnetOwnerHotkey UID carrying the MinerBurned fraction is its own `burned_alpha` leg, so this is what miners actually receive.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"burned_alpha\",\"description\":\"Emission landing on the subnet's burn sink -- the UID holding `SubtensorModule.SubnetOwnerHotkey` while `SubtensorModule.MinerBurned` > 0. It rode the miner leg before #11094, overstating what miners receive by 1/(1-burn); 0 on a subnet that burns nothing.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"uid_alpha\",\"description\":\"Emission across the whole UID set. This is NOT the day's total emission: the subnet owner's cut is paid outside the UID set, so this is the distributable remainder — see `total_alpha`.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"validator_share_of_uid\",\"description\":\"Validator share of the observed per-UID emission. MEASURED and parameter-free — a ratio of two sums this response also publishes. Null when the day emitted nothing, never 0, which would read as 'validators received none of it'.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"burned_share_of_uid\",\"description\":\"burned_alpha / uid_alpha. With `validator_share_of_uid` and `miner_share_of_uid` this sums to 1 over the UID set; null when the day emitted nothing.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"miner_share_of_uid\",\"description\":\"Miner share of the observed per-UID emission. Measured.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"owner_cut\",\"description\":\"The owner share applied to this day. `SubnetOwnerCut` is 11796/65535 — 18%, not 1/6 — and is UNSET on chain, so this is the runtime default rather than a read. Published so a reader can see which constant produced the reconstructed fields.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"total_alpha\",\"description\":\"The whole day's alpha emission: `alpha_out_emission x 7200 blocks`. RECONSTRUCTED. Null when the day's snapshot carries no `alpha_out_emission` — the measured legs are still published beside it, because a validator/miner split is a real answer even when the day's total is not known.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"owner_alpha\",\"description\":\"The owner leg, `total_alpha x owner_cut`. RECONSTRUCTED. It is NOT summed from the rows — the owner cut is paid outside the UID set, so no per-UID row carries it.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"owner_share\",\"description\":\"Owner share of the whole day. Reconstructed. `owner_share + validator_share + miner_share` sums to 1 within rao precision.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"validator_share\",\"description\":\"Validator share of the WHOLE day, owner leg included — so it is strictly below `validator_share_of_uid`, which is a share of the distributable remainder only. Reconstructed.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"tao_usd\",\"description\":\"The day's last PRICED usd_per_tao observation from the TAO/USD index (#9609) -- the rate every *_usd_day leg below used. Null before the series began (2026-08-02) or on an unpriceable day; the legs are null with it.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"total_usd_day\",\"description\":\"RECONSTRUCTED (#11095): total_alpha x alpha_price_tao x tao_usd. The whole chain of assumptions is visible in this point's own fields; null when any link is. Do not hand-roll this from an assumed split constant -- the shares here are measured.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"owner_usd_day\",\"description\":\"owner_alpha x alpha_price_tao x tao_usd; null as above.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"validator_usd_day\",\"description\":\"The distributable day total x the MEASURED validator_share_of_uid, priced. Null when any input is.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"miner_usd_day\",\"description\":\"What the subnet's miners collectively received that day in USD: the distributable day total x the MEASURED miner_share_of_uid (burn sink excluded), priced through the day's alpha price and TAO/USD rate. THE figure a revenue screen wants, derived from measured shares rather than an assumed constant.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"burned_usd_day\",\"description\":\"The burn sink's leg, priced the same way. What the subnet recycles per day in USD terms.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"miner_share\",\"description\":\"Miner share of the whole day. Reconstructed.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"alpha_price_tao\",\"description\":\"The day's alpha price in TAO, from the same daily snapshot. This is `SubnetMovingPrice`, the chain's emission-weighting average — not a traded mark.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"total_tao\",\"description\":\"`total_alpha` priced through `alpha_price_tao`. Reconstructed, and null whenever either input is.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetEmissionSplitMinerEarnings\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"earning_miner_count\",\"description\":\"Miner UIDs that recorded emission on ANY day of the window. A WINDOW count, deliberately not a live one: /chain/concentration/subnets publishes an `earning_miner_count` of its own read off the current snapshot, so the two differ by the miners that earned earlier in the window and do not right now -- and the smaller live number is the one that describes today.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"zero_miner_count\",\"description\":\"Miner UIDs seen in the window that never recorded emission -- published beside the percentiles because on the median subnet this is most of them, and a distribution over earners alone reads as universal income.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"p50_alpha_day\",\"description\":\"The MEDIAN earning miner's alpha per day: their share of the window's summed miner emission (validators and the burn sink excluded) x the basis point's miner_alpha_day. Nearest-rank, so it is a real miner's figure and not an interpolation.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"p75_alpha_day\",\"description\":\"The 75th-percentile earning miner's alpha per day, same derivation as p50.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"p90_alpha_day\",\"description\":\"The 90th-percentile earning miner's alpha per day, same derivation as p50.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"top_alpha_day\",\"description\":\"The single largest earning miner's alpha per day. A ceiling, never a typical figure -- on a concentrated subnet it is multiples of p90.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"p50_usd_day\",\"description\":\"What the MEDIAN earning miner makes per day in USD -- each UID's share of the window's summed miner emission (validators and the burn sink excluded) x the newest point's miner_usd_day. Null when that point's USD chain is (no priced tao-usd day, unknown alpha price).\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"p75_usd_day\",\"description\":\"The 75th-percentile earning miner's USD per day, same derivation as p50_usd_day.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"p90_usd_day\",\"description\":\"The 90th-percentile earning miner's USD per day, same derivation as p50_usd_day.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"top_usd_day\",\"description\":\"The single largest earning miner's USD per day. A ceiling, never a typical figure.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"basis_date\",\"description\":\"The point whose per-day legs priced these figures -- the newest in the window.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetMinerFairness\",\"description\":\"Whether a subnet's registered miners actually earn, measured over a 7d/30d/90d window rather than from a snapshot. Reports the daily zero-emission rate, how many days each miner UID earned on (persistent-zero and occasionally-zero are different facts a snapshot collapses), and emission concentration across controlling entities as the headline lens with the per-UID lens beside it. DESCRIPTIVE ONLY — there is no fairness score and no grade: a high Gini on a subnet whose task genuinely has one best answer is not misconduct, and that context is not in this data. A subnet with no daily rollup resolves to a schema-stable empty series (days_covered 0), never null. Mirrors GET /api/v1/subnets/{netuid}/miner-fairness.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"schema_version\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"netuid\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"window\",\"description\":\"The resolved window label (7d/30d/90d).\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"point_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"points\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"LIST\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"SubnetMinerFairnessPoint\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}}}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"days_covered\",\"description\":\"How many days the series actually covers. Published beside every distribution figure: a distribution over 3 days and one over 31 are not the same claim, and `neuron_daily` is only ~27-33 days deep, so a 90d window is answered with the depth found rather than refused.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"miner_uid_count\",\"description\":\"Distinct non-validator UIDs seen anywhere in the window — the denominator for the persistence block.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"persistence\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetMinerFairnessPersistence\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"entity_count\",\"description\":\"Distinct controlling addresses behind those UIDs, keyed on the `coldkey` field. A UID with no owner recorded counts as its own entity, so this never under-counts unknown owners — merging them would make a subnet look more concentrated than it is.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"uids_per_entity\",\"description\":\"Miner UIDs per controlling entity. 1.0 = every UID a distinct owner; higher = fewer operators each running many hotkeys. The network median is ~3.08 and the maximum ~21.3, so '256 miners' is routinely far fewer operators.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"concentration\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetMinerFairnessConcentration\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"live\",\"description\":\"THE CAPTURE TRIPWIRE: the same two lenses over the CURRENT metagraph, beside the windowed ones -- because a window aggregate smooths away a mid-window capture event. SN75 reported a 30d uid gini of 0.77 while one UID held incentive 0.9908 live; when these lenses diverge violently from `concentration`, trust these. Null when the current-metagraph store has no rows for this subnet.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetMinerFairnessLive\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"burn_uid\",\"description\":\"The UID excluded from every figure above as the subnet's BURN SINK (#11094): the chain routes `SubtensorModule.MinerBurned` of miner incentive to the `SubtensorModule.SubnetOwnerHotkey` UID, so it is not a miner and counting it would inflate each distribution by 1/(1-burn). Null when the subnet burns nothing -- no row was excluded.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"field_sources\",\"description\":\"Per-field { kind, storage } provenance map: every value is labelled measured (with the pallet-qualified storage item it was read from) or reconstructed (our arithmetic over measurements, storage null). ADR 0023 decision 5.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"JSON\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetMinerFairnessPoint\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"snapshot_date\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"miner_count\",\"description\":\"Non-validator UIDs registered on this day. This is the number every leaderboard publishes as 'miners'.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"earning_miner_count\",\"description\":\"How many of them recorded emission above zero. Against `miner_count` this is the fact a miner count alone hides — on the median subnet almost none of the registered miners earn on a given day.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"zero_emission_pct\",\"description\":\"Fraction of this day's miner UIDs that earned nothing. Null — never 0 — on a day with no miner UIDs at all, because 0% over an empty population reads as 'everybody earned'. A SINGLE DAY OVERSTATES this: emission is a per-tempo rate and a UID paid on a different tempo reads as a zero here. Use the persistence block for the durable version.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetMinerFairnessPersistence\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"never_earned_count\",\"description\":\"Miner UIDs that earned on ZERO days of the window. Distinct from the daily zero rate: this is the population that is not in the game at all, rather than the one that missed a tempo.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"earned_every_day_count\",\"description\":\"Miner UIDs that earned on every day they were registered for.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"median_earning_days\",\"description\":\"The typical miner's earning days across the window. Null on an empty population — the median of nothing is not zero, and zero would read as 'the typical miner earned on no days'.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"max_earning_days\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetMinerFairnessConcentration\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"entity\",\"description\":\"THE HEADLINE LENS: emission concentration across controlling entities (coldkeys), with each entity's UIDs summed. A subnet with three operators behind 256 UIDs is not diverse, and the per-UID lens alone hides exactly that. The distribution is each entity's miner emission summed across the window's `days_covered` days, where each day contributes that day's captured PER-TEMPO alpha rate (the `emission_tao` convention) -- so `total` is a within-subnet ranking mass, not a window payout total, and never TAO.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"ConcentrationMetrics\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"uid\",\"description\":\"The same measures per UID, published beside the entity lens rather than instead of it. Where the two diverge, several UIDs share an operator. Same distribution and unit as the entity lens: window-summed daily per-tempo alpha samples.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"ConcentrationMetrics\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetMinerFairnessLive\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"captured_at\",\"description\":\"Epoch-ms stamp of the newest current-metagraph row the lenses below were computed from -- read this against the window: these lenses are NOW, the ones under `concentration` are the whole window.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"block_number\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"entity\",\"description\":\"The entity lens over the CURRENT per-UID incentive distribution (miners only). Incentive is the chain's live ranking and already a share, so `total` is the miners' summed incentive. Null when no miner carries any.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetMinerFairnessLiveEntity\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"uid\",\"description\":\"The per-UID lens over the same current incentive distribution.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetMinerFairnessLiveUid\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetMinerFairnessLiveEntity\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"holders\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"total\",\"description\":\"The sum of the distribution this lens was computed over, in that distribution's own unit and window -- the FIELD EMBEDDING this lens names both (window-summed per-tempo alpha samples on miner-fairness, incentive shares on performance, block counts on blocks-summary). Never comparable across routes: two lenses over different distributions share these measures, not a unit.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"gini\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"hhi\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"hhi_normalized\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"nakamoto_coefficient\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"top_1pct_share\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"top_5pct_share\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"top_10pct_share\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"top_20pct_share\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"entropy\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"entropy_normalized\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetMinerFairnessLiveUid\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"holders\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"total\",\"description\":\"The sum of the distribution this lens was computed over, in that distribution's own unit and window -- the FIELD EMBEDDING this lens names both (window-summed per-tempo alpha samples on miner-fairness, incentive shares on performance, block counts on blocks-summary). Never comparable across routes: two lenses over different distributions share these measures, not a unit.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"gini\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"hhi\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"hhi_normalized\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"nakamoto_coefficient\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"top_1pct_share\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"top_5pct_share\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"top_10pct_share\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"top_20pct_share\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"entropy\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"entropy_normalized\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetCostToParticipate\",\"description\":\"What one subnet says it takes to participate, and what the chain charges to enter. Three kinds of number, not interchangeable: `entry_cost` is measured on chain and exact; `declared_compute` is what the subnet's own min_compute file SAYS, from a template that is filled in inconsistently; `earnings` is what miners there actually earned. NO COST PER DAY IS PUBLISHED — of the 18 registered declarations 5 ask for a GPU, so crossing the fleet with a rental rate priced hardware most subnets never asked for. A declared minimum is the floor to RUN, not the spec to EARN. Mirrors GET /api/v1/subnets/{netuid}/cost-to-participate.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"schema_version\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"netuid\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"entry_cost\",\"description\":\"What the CHAIN charges to enter. Exact, measured, and the only hard numbers in this card.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"SubnetEntryCost\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"declarations_read\",\"description\":\"How many of this subnet's registered min_compute declarations have been read. ZERO IS THE IMPORTANT VALUE: 111 of 129 subnets register none, and a card with `declarations_read: 0` makes no claim about what running here takes.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"declared_compute\",\"description\":\"The headline declaration: the first read that found a spec. Miner and validator are kept apart because a subnet whose validator needs a GPU and whose miner does not is ordinary, and one answer for both would be wrong for one of them. A file that draws no such distinction publishes under `unscoped` instead, with both roles null — read all three, because which one carries the answer is a property of the document rather than of the subnet.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"SubnetDeclaredCompute\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"declarations\",\"description\":\"Every declaration read for this subnet. A subnet registering two files that disagree keeps both here rather than being collapsed to whichever was read last.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"LIST\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"SubnetComputeDeclaration\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}}}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"earnings\",\"description\":\"What miners here actually earned, projected from /api/v1/subnets/{netuid}/miner-fairness — never recomputed. Present so a floor-to-run can never sit on the page without the distribution that says whether running is worth it. Deliberately carries NO mean earning: that would invite exactly the cost-minus-revenue arithmetic these numbers do not support.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetParticipationEarnings\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"not_modelled\",\"description\":\"What this card does NOT account for, served in the payload rather than left on a docs page — so an agent quoting the numbers carries the caveats with them.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"LIST\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}}}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"field_sources\",\"description\":\"Per-field { kind, storage } provenance map: every value is labelled measured (with the pallet-qualified storage item it was read from) or reconstructed (our arithmetic over measurements, storage null). ADR 0023 decision 5.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"JSON\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetEntryCost\",\"description\":\"What the CHAIN charges to enter. Exact, measured, and the only hard numbers in this card.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"registration_cost_tao\",\"description\":\"What one registration costs on this subnet right now, from `subnet_burn_history` — the same value /api/v1/subnets/{netuid}/burn serves, re-served rather than recomputed. EXACT and on-chain. Null means not read; zero is a real price (netuid 76 reads a true zero), so the two are never conflated.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"validator_permit_floor_tao\",\"description\":\"The stake that would currently buy a validator permit, from /api/v1/subnets/{netuid}/validator-economics. A permit is not income — see the earning floor beside it.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"validator_earning_floor_tao\",\"description\":\"The stake at which a validator actually starts earning dividends here. Differs from the permit floor by a median of ~7x across subnets.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetDeclaredCompute\",\"description\":\"The headline declaration: the first read that found a spec. Miner and validator are kept apart because a subnet whose validator needs a GPU and whose miner does not is ordinary, and one answer for both would be wrong for one of them. A file that draws no such distinction publishes under `unscoped` instead, with both roles null — read all three, because which one carries the answer is a property of the document rather than of the subnet.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"miner\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetDeclaredComputeSpec\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"validator\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetDeclaredComputeSpec\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"unscoped\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetDeclaredComputeSpec\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"evidence\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetComputeDeclarationEvidence\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetDeclaredComputeSpec\",\"description\":\"One role's DECLARED minimum, in the subnet's own numbers. Units are carried in the field names; nothing is converted or defaulted. This is the floor to RUN, never the spec to EARN.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"gpu\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"SubnetDeclaredGpu\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"cpu\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"SubnetDeclaredCpu\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"memory\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"SubnetDeclaredMemory\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"storage\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"SubnetDeclaredStorage\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"network\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"SubnetDeclaredNetwork\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetDeclaredGpu\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"requirement\",\"description\":\"Does this role need a GPU, as the DECLARATION supports it? FOUR answers. `required` and `not-required` are what they say. `declared-inconsistently` is a declared `required: False` sitting beside a non-zero minimum VRAM, CUDA-core or GPU count — the shape an unedited template field takes beside an edited one, and never coerced to either boolean. `null` means no GPU stanza was declared at all, which is not a 'no'.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"declared_required\",\"description\":\"The file's own `required:` value, published verbatim so a reader can see why `requirement` is not a boolean rather than take our word for it.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Boolean\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"declared_min_vram_gb\",\"description\":\"The file's own `min_vram`, in the GB the template asks for. Not converted, not rounded — a declaration we alter is no longer the subnet's declaration.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"declared_min_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"declared_model\",\"description\":\"The file's own `recommended_gpu`. RECOMMENDED, not required: naming a card for a workload that does not need one is coherent, so this never moves `requirement` on its own.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetDeclaredCpu\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"min_cores\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"min_speed_ghz\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"architecture\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetDeclaredMemory\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"min_ram_gb\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"min_swap_gb\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetDeclaredStorage\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"min_space_gb\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"min_iops\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"type\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetDeclaredNetwork\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"min_download_speed_mbps\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"min_upload_speed_mbps\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetComputeDeclarationEvidence\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"source_url\",\"description\":\"The registered min_compute surface that was read. Points at a branch, correctly — a human clicks this and wants the current file. The pinned half is `read_at_sha`.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"read_at_sha\",\"description\":\"The commit that was HEAD when the file was read. THE CITATION: it is what a re-read diffs against to know the declaration moved.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"spec_version\",\"description\":\"The file's own `version:` key. Worth seeing beside the spec: a subnet that has bumped it has revisited the declaration, one still on the template's default has not.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"observed_at\",\"description\":\"When this reading was taken. A declared minimum with no date cannot be aged out.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"first_seen\",\"description\":\"When this file was first read, preserved across re-reads.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetComputeDeclaration\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"evidence\",\"description\":\"The citation. `read_at_sha` is the commit that was HEAD when the file was read — 14 of the 18 registered surfaces point at `main`, which moves under the claim.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"SubnetComputeDeclarationEvidence\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"found\",\"description\":\"Did the fetch yield a parseable compute_spec? `false` IS A MEASUREMENT — the file was read at that commit and declared nothing — and is distinct from a subnet that registers no min_compute surface at all, which has no declaration here.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Boolean\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"miner\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetDeclaredComputeSpec\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"validator\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetDeclaredComputeSpec\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"unscoped\",\"description\":\"Requirements this file declared WITHOUT saying whose they are — a flat `compute_spec` with no `miner`/`validator` split. Non-null only for a document that made no role distinction, in which case `miner` and `validator` are both null because that is true of the file. Same shape as the other two, so the four-valued GPU answer reads identically. Never a guess at which role was meant: attributing an unattributed requirement is the one thing this key exists to avoid.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetDeclaredComputeSpec\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetParticipationEarnings\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"days_covered\",\"description\":\"How many days the distribution beside it was measured over. A zero-rate over 3 days and one over 31 are not the same claim.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"miner_uid_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"zero_emission_pct\",\"description\":\"The share of this subnet's miner UIDs that earned nothing on the most recent day, as a fraction. The network median is 0.992.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"never_earned_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"median_earning_days\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetTreasury\",\"description\":\"What one subnet's own published source says it allocates to a treasury, against what the chain shows. Some subnets take a share of miner emission in their own validator code, applied before emission is ever assigned — that is not a chain event and no indexer can see it. A cut disclosed in a public repo is a BUSINESS MODEL, not a finding, and for most subnets the answer is that declared matches observed. THREE STATES MUST NOT BE COLLAPSED: no reading at all (nobody looked), a reading with `found: false` (read at a commit, found nothing — evidence), and a reading with a share. Machine readings are published as `candidate` with their finding withheld until a maintainer reviews them. Mirrors GET /api/v1/subnets/{netuid}/treasury.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"schema_version\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"netuid\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"repos_read\",\"description\":\"How many of this subnet's registered source repositories have been read. ZERO IS THE IMPORTANT VALUE: it means nobody has looked, which is NOT the same as looking and finding no treasury cut. A card with `repos_read: 0` makes no claim about this subnet at all.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"reviewed_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"pending_review_count\",\"description\":\"Readings a machine produced that no maintainer has checked. Their findings are deliberately withheld from this payload — a model's or a regex's summary of source code is not evidence.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"declared_share\",\"description\":\"The total REVIEWED allocation taken from miner emission, as a fraction. Null when nothing reviewed applies. A treasury cut written into a public repo is a DISCLOSED BUSINESS MODEL, not a discovery.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"observed_share\",\"description\":\"What the chain shows reaching the owner, from the owner-capture index. Null when it cannot be measured for this subnet.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"declared_matches_observed\",\"description\":\"Does the declared allocation agree with what the chain shows? TRI-STATE, and `null` — the comparison was not possible because one side is unread — is the normal answer today. Null must never be rendered as `false`: that reads as 'the team is not doing what they said', which is precisely the claim an unread repo cannot support. AGREEMENT IS THE EXPECTED RESULT and is published as prominently as divergence.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Boolean\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"readings\",\"description\":\"One entry per repository read. An empty list means nobody has read this subnet's sources — not that it takes no treasury cut.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"LIST\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"SubnetTreasuryReading\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}}}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"field_sources\",\"description\":\"Per-field { kind, storage } provenance map: every value is labelled measured (with the pallet-qualified storage item it was read from) or reconstructed (our arithmetic over measurements, storage null). ADR 0023 decision 5.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"JSON\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetTreasuryReading\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"review_state\",\"description\":\"How far this reading has got through the human gate. A `candidate` is a machine reading nobody has checked: its READ STATUS is published (which repo, which commit, when) and its FINDING is not. Only `reviewed` rows publish a share.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"evidence\",\"description\":\"The citation. `read_at_sha` is the commit that was HEAD when the repo was read, which is what makes the finding re-derivable by someone who does not trust us.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"SubnetTreasuryEvidence\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"found\",\"description\":\"Did this read find an allocation? THREE STATES: `true` (found, reviewed), `false` (READ AT A COMMIT AND FOUND NOTHING — a measurement, and the expected answer for most subnets), and `null` (not yet reviewed, so no finding is published). A subnet nobody has read has no reading at all rather than a `false`.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Boolean\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"declared_share\",\"description\":\"The declared allocation as a FRACTION (0..1), never a percentage. Null when the reading found nothing or has not been reviewed.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"treasury_address\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"applies_to\",\"description\":\"What the allocation is taken out of. Shares with different bases are never summed — a payout fee and an emission cut are not the same quantity.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetTreasuryEvidence\",\"description\":\"The citation. `read_at_sha` is the commit that was HEAD when the repo was read, which is what makes the finding re-derivable by someone who does not trust us.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"source_url\",\"description\":\"The public repository surface that was read. Points at a branch, correctly — a human clicks this and wants the current code. The pinned half is `read_at_sha`.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"read_at_sha\",\"description\":\"The commit that was HEAD when this repo was read. THE CITATION: it is what makes the finding re-derivable by someone who does not trust us, and what a re-read diffs against to know the repo moved.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"evidence_path\",\"description\":\"Where in the repo, so a reviewer opens the right file rather than the whole project.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"observed_at\",\"description\":\"When this reading was taken. A citation without a date cannot be aged out, and a repo that has moved since is exactly what re-reading exists to catch.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"first_seen\",\"description\":\"When this repo was first read, preserved across re-reads — so 'we have been watching this since' survives a repo that moves weekly.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetOwnerCapture\",\"description\":\"How much of one subnet's emission reaches its owner, over a 7d/30d/90d window, newest first — the protocol cut (L1) and emission landing on owner-held UIDs (L2), which are both chain-visible. What the owner ULTIMATELY KEEPS is not published: that depends on the stake behind those validators (L3) and on any application-layer treasury cut (L4), and `blind_spots` states both in the response. Every other stakeholder address reports `verdict: unresolved`, which is the honest default and not a negative finding. A subnet with no daily rollup resolves to a schema-stable empty series (point_count 0), never null. Mirrors GET /api/v1/subnets/{netuid}/owner-capture.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"schema_version\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"netuid\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"window\",\"description\":\"The resolved window label (7d/30d/90d).\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"point_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"points\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"LIST\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"SubnetOwnerCapturePoint\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}}}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"owner_coldkey\",\"description\":\"The subnet's declared owner coldkey, from SubtensorModule.SubnetOwner. Null when no ownership row has been captured — in which case every owner-derived field is null rather than 0.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"owner_uid_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"owner_uids\",\"description\":\"The owner-held UIDs on the NEWEST day only, and who is staked behind them. Newest-day rather than unioned across the window, because a UID set unioned over a month lists neurons that have since deregistered as though they were current.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"LIST\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"SubnetOwnerCaptureUid\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"attribution\",\"description\":\"Every stakeholder address staked behind the owner's validator UIDs, largest share first, each with its verdict. An empty list means no positions were captured, not that nobody is staked.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"LIST\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"SubnetOwnerCaptureStakeholder\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"attribution_vocabulary\",\"description\":\"The four defined verdicts, published beside the verdicts themselves so a caller can tell `unresolved` is a state rather than a missing value.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"LIST\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"blind_spots\",\"description\":\"What this measurement cannot see, in the payload rather than only in the docs — because the payload is what gets quoted. Covers the stake behind owner validators (L3), application-layer treasury cuts (L4), and root delegation (L5).\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"LIST\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"SubnetOwnerCaptureBlindSpot\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"field_sources\",\"description\":\"Per-field { kind, storage } provenance map: every value is labelled measured (with the pallet-qualified storage item it was read from) or reconstructed (our arithmetic over measurements, storage null). ADR 0023 decision 5.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"JSON\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetOwnerCapturePoint\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"snapshot_date\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"neuron_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"owner_cut_share\",\"description\":\"L1 — the protocol owner cut applied to this day. `SubnetOwnerCut` is 11796/65535 (18%, not 1/6) and is UNSET on chain, so this is the runtime default rather than a read. Every subnet pays it and no subnet chooses it.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"owner_cut_alpha\",\"description\":\"The L1 leg in alpha, `total_alpha x owner_cut_share`. RECONSTRUCTED — it is not summed from per-UID rows, because the owner cut is paid outside the UID set entirely.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"owner_uid_count\",\"description\":\"How many UIDs on this day were held by the declared `owner_coldkey`. NULL when the `owner_coldkey` is unknown — which is a different fact from 0, and 0 is the one that reads as 'the owner runs nothing here'.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"owner_uid_alpha\",\"description\":\"L2 — emission that landed on UIDs held by the `owner_coldkey`. MEASURED from neuron_daily. Alpha-denominated: comparable within one subnet, never across subnets without the price join.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"uid_alpha\",\"description\":\"Emission across the whole UID set on this day. NOT the day's total — the owner cut is paid outside the UID set, so this is the distributable remainder. See `total_alpha`.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"total_alpha\",\"description\":\"The whole day's alpha emission, `alpha_out_emission x 7200 blocks`. RECONSTRUCTED, and the same basis /owner-cut and /emission-split/history use, so the three cannot disagree about what a day of emission is.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"owner_attributed_share_of_uid\",\"description\":\"`owner_uid_alpha / uid_alpha`. MEASURED and parameter-free — a ratio of two observed sums this response also publishes, carrying no owner-cut assumption. Null when the day emitted nothing to any UID, never 0.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"owner_attributed_share\",\"description\":\"L2 as a share of the WHOLE day, `owner_uid_alpha / total_alpha`. RECONSTRUCTED, because the denominator is. ATTRIBUTED, NOT CAPTURED: this is emission that landed on owner-held UIDs, not what the owner ultimately keeps — the stake behind those UIDs (L3) and any application-layer treasury cut (L4) are outside what the chain shows. See `blind_spots`.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"owner_combined_share\",\"description\":\"`owner_cut_share + owner_attributed_share` — the two chain-visible layers over one denominator. Named for the arithmetic it is. It is NOT 'what the owner takes', and a caller reporting it as such is asserting L3 and L4 this surface explicitly does not measure.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetOwnerCaptureUid\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"uid\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"hotkey\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"validator_permit\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Boolean\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"emission_tao\",\"description\":\"This UID's emission on the newest day, alpha-denominated for every non-root subnet despite the column's `_tao` suffix.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"take\",\"description\":\"Validator take/commission (0..1) from SubtensorModule::Delegates. GLOBAL per hotkey, not per subnet. NULL means no Delegates entry at capture — which is not 0%, and must not be rendered as one.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"owner_stake_share\",\"description\":\"Fraction of the stake behind this hotkey held by the `owner_coldkey` itself. Measured from nominator_positions. Null when the position set for this hotkey is not provably whole — see `stake_split_reason`.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"nominator_share\",\"description\":\"`1 - owner_stake_share`: the fraction of this validator's stake that is NOT the `owner_coldkey`'s. MEASURED, and published with no interpretation attached. A high value is not evidence of anything — a custodial exchange, a delegation service, an unaffiliated whale and a team wallet all produce this identical shape. Resolving which is L3, and is not done here.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"stake_split_reason\",\"description\":\"Why the stake split is null, when it is. A short sentence rather than a code, because the reasons are not a closed set the caller should branch on.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetOwnerCaptureStakeholder\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"coldkey\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"verdict\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"evidence\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"LIST\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"AttributionEvidence\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}}}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"stake_share\",\"description\":\"This address's summed share of the stake behind the owner's validator UIDs on this subnet. Per-subnet: alpha is a different token per subnet and these fractions are never summed across netuids.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Float\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"AttributionEvidence\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"kind\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"source_url\",\"description\":\"A public page a reader can open — the subnet's own docs, repo or site. Pin a repo citation to a commit SHA; a branch moves under the claim.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"extrinsic_hash\",\"description\":\"The extrinsic that carried the funding path or key rotation, so the link can be re-derived from chain rather than trusted.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"observed_at\",\"description\":\"When this was established. Evidence goes stale: a wallet relationship true last quarter may not be true today, and a citation without a date cannot be aged out.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetOwnerCaptureBlindSpot\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"layer\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"summary\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetPerformance\",\"description\":\"Per-subnet reward-distribution & score-spread card (#5714). Metric blocks are null on a cold/empty subnet. Mirrors GET /api/v1/subnets/{netuid}/performance.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"schema_version\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"netuid\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"neuron_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"validator_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"active_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"captured_at\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"incentive\",\"description\":\"Incentive concentration across all neurons with positive incentive; null when none carry any.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"ConcentrationMetrics\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"dividends\",\"description\":\"Dividends concentration across permitted validators only; null when no permitted validator earns any.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"ConcentrationMetrics\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"trust\",\"description\":\"Trust score spread across all neurons; null when none carries a finite trust.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"ScoreDistribution\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"depreca