undary from where the nulls stop.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"priced_day_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"usd_unavailable\",\"description\":\"Why NO day could be priced, or null. `read_failed` means the index could not be queried, which is not a claim about the index itself.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"field_sources_usd\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"AlphaUsdFieldSource\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"EconomicsTrendsDay\",\"description\":\"One UTC day of network-wide economics aggregated across every subnet with a snapshot that day. Sums are null only when no subnet reported a value that day.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"snapshot_date\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"subnet_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"total_stake_alpha\",\"description\":\"Lossless fixed 9-decimal (rao-precision) TAO string, summed across every subnet reporting that day -- exceeds the exact-double ceiling as a JSON number, so it is served as a string rather than Float.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"alpha_price_tao_weighted\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"alpha_price_tao_median\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"alpha_price_usd_weighted\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"alpha_price_usd_median\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"usd_per_tao\",\"description\":\"The TAO/USD rate this day's _usd fields were multiplied by -- the last reading observed inside that UTC day.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"validator_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"miner_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"mean_emission_share\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetRevenueCard\",\"description\":\"One subnet's external revenue against the TAO the network emits to it. coverage_ratio and subsidy_multiple are NULL whenever revenue is not observed, which is the normal case — 127 of 129 subnets publish no readable figure, and rendering them as 0% covered would be a false claim about each of them. Mirrors GET /api/v1/subnets/{netuid}/revenue.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"contract_version\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"generated_at\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"notes\",\"description\":\"Public-safe notes; may be a string or a string list depending on the adapter.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"JSON\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"schema_version\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"netuid\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"revenue\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"SubnetRevenue\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"field_sources\",\"description\":\"Per-field { kind, storage } provenance map: every value is labelled measured (with the pallet-qualified storage item it was read from) or reconstructed (our arithmetic over measurements, storage null). ADR 0023 decision 5.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"JSON\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetRevenue\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"netuid\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"window_days\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"emission\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"RevenueEmission\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"revenue_usd\",\"description\":\"NULL means not observed. Never zero-by-default: a subnet that earned nothing and a subnet nobody has read are different facts.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"provenance\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"searched_at\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"coverage_ratio\",\"description\":\"revenue / emission. NULL whenever revenue_usd is null, which is the majority case. A client must render null as 'not observed', never as 0%.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"subsidy_multiple\",\"description\":\"emission / revenue, the ecosystem's own phrasing. NULL when revenue is null OR zero — dividing by zero is undefined, not infinite, and Infinity would sort as the worst possible subsidy rather than as not-applicable.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"sources\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"LIST\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"RevenueSource\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}}}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"verification\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"RevenueVerification\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"RevenueEmission\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"basis\",\"description\":\"SubnetTaoInEmission + SubnetExcessTao, the TAO the network directs into this subnet. Fully measured rather than reconstructed. The alternates are published beside it and never silently substituted.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"tao\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Float\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"usd\",\"description\":\"The measured TAO denominator priced in USD, or NULL when the TAO/USD index could not price this moment. NEVER 0 — `emission.tao` carries a real figure, so a zero here reads as 'the network directs this much TAO into the subnet and it is worth nothing', which is what shipped for all 129 subnets until the TAO/USD wiring was fixed.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"alternates\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"RevenueEmissionAlternates\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"RevenueEmissionAlternates\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"alpha_out_priced\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"RevenueCoverageBasis\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"owner_take\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"RevenueCoverageBasis\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"RevenueCoverageBasis\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"tao\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Float\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"usd\",\"description\":\"The TAO leg priced through the TAO/USD index, or NULL when that moment is not priceable — an index below its two-pool quorum, a reading past its two-hour freshness bound, or no reading at all. NEVER 0: a zero here next to a positive `tao` claims the emission is worthless rather than unpriced, which is what this field published for all 129 subnets until the TAO/USD wiring was fixed.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"RevenueSource\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"surface_id\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"provenance\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"currency\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"grain\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"supersedes\",\"description\":\"Surface ids this one subsumes. A subsumed surface is reported here with its own figure and NEVER contributes to `revenue_usd` — SN64 publishes both an all-channel daily total and a TAO-channel subset of it, and summing the two inflates the headline.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"LIST\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"amount_usd\",\"description\":\"The figure for the requested window, or null. Null when the surface declares revenue but nothing has been read from it (an auth-gated endpoint, or a probe that has not run), when its grain cannot form the window, or when the window is only partly observed — a partial sum presented as a whole window understates.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"contributes\",\"description\":\"Whether this surface's figure reached `revenue_usd`. Published per source so a caller can see WHY a subnet with visible figures reports a null headline, instead of inferring it.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Boolean\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"excluded_reason\",\"description\":\"Null when it contributed; otherwise why it did not — superseded, provenance not headline-eligible, not observed, or a grain that cannot span the window.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"periods_observed\",\"description\":\"How many distinct periods were seen for this surface within the window.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"periods_expected\",\"description\":\"How many the window requires at this surface's grain. Absent when the grain carries no period at all (a cumulative total) or does not divide the window.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"response_hash\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"observed_at\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"RevenueVerification\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"verified\",\"description\":\"False means the response is not defensible and must not be presented as fact. Mirrors the emission-pipeline convention.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Boolean\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"checks\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"LIST\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"RevenueVerificationCheck\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}}}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"RevenueVerificationCheck\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"name\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"ok\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Boolean\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"detail\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"ChainRevenueCoverage\",\"description\":\"Every subnet's revenue coverage in one response. Subnets with no observed revenue are INCLUDED with null ratios rather than dropped, because omitting them would make the covered set look like the whole network. Mirrors GET /api/v1/chain/revenue-coverage.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"contract_version\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"generated_at\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"notes\",\"description\":\"Public-safe notes; may be a string or a string list depending on the adapter.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"JSON\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"schema_version\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"window_days\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"observed_count\",\"description\":\"How many subnets have a readable revenue figure. Against subnet_count this is the honest headline, stated rather than left to be inferred from nulls.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"subnet_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"subnets\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"LIST\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"SubnetRevenue\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}}}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"EmissionPipeline\",\"description\":\"The v440 emission pipeline replayed over one pinned block (#8744) -- the per-subnet share decomposition, the network aggregate, and the identity checks evaluated on the rows being served.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"schema_version\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"chain_state\",\"description\":\"The block every input below was pinned to. Required: without it nothing here can be verified.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"EmissionPipelineChainState\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"block_emission_tao\",\"description\":\"Block emission derived from TotalIssuance at that block, never read from the stale BlockEmission storage item.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"block_emission_halvings\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"subnets\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"LIST\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"SubnetEmissionDecomposition\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}}}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"matched_subnet_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"returned_subnet_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"aggregate\",\"description\":\"Network-wide totals across every row in the capture -- unchanged by the netuid argument, which narrows the per-subnet rows only.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"EmissionPipelineAggregate\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"verification\",\"description\":\"The four identities, evaluated on the rows being served rather than read from a stored flag -- a stored flag can be green while THIS response is broken, and it can go stale. ADR 0023 decision 3.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"EmissionPipelineVerification\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"field_sources\",\"description\":\"Per-field { kind, storage } provenance map: every value is labelled measured (with the pallet-qualified storage item it was read from) or reconstructed (our arithmetic over measurements, storage null). ADR 0023 decision 5.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"JSON\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"EmissionPipelineChainState\",\"description\":\"The chain state the decomposition's inputs were pinned to. theta/q/h are read AS STORED at this block -- the runtime gates with the stored bar between its 360-block recomputes, so a live read is the wrong number for 359 blocks out of 360.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"block\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"block_hash\",\"description\":\"The block hash, so the pinning is exact -- a height alone is ambiguous across a reorg.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"total_issuance_tao\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Float\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"emission_gate_bar\",\"description\":\"theta. Null when the bar is unset, which disables the gate outright.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"emission_bar_quantile\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"emission_gate_exponent\",\"description\":\"h. Null means the runtime default 3, NOT zero -- h = 0 makes the Hill gate a constant 0.5 for every subnet.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"network_immunity_period\",\"description\":\"SubtensorModule.NetworkImmunityPeriod -- how many blocks after registration a subnet cannot be deregistered. Null on a blob captured before this read existed.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetEmissionDecomposition\",\"description\":\"One subnet's path through stages 0-8. Every share is a fraction of block emission, null where stage 0 excluded the subnet from the distribution entirely.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"netuid\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"ineligible_reason\",\"description\":\"Non-null (root, never_emitted, subtoken_disabled, registration_closed) means the subnet took no part in stage 1, and every downstream share is null rather than 0 -- 'not in the distribution' is not 'in it with nothing'.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"moving_price\",\"description\":\"SubtensorModule.SubnetMovingPrice in TAO -- the EMA of the subnet's alpha price and stage 1's raw input. Published unnormalized because it is the quantity the runtime compares when deciding which subnet to deregister; emission_share divides it by the sum across subnets, so a caller cannot recover it from anything else here. Null for a subnet with no positive moving price (root, and the never-emitted set).\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"emission_share\",\"description\":\"Stage 1, the published emission_share (ADR 0023 decision 1) -- the PRICE share, not the share of TAO received.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"miner_burned\",\"description\":\"Stage 2 input. A FRACTION in [0,1], never an amount.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Float\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"weighted_share\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"gated_share\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"emission_enabled\",\"description\":\"PUBLISHED, NOT INFERRED. A subnet far enough below the bar has its gated share underflow to exactly 0, so an enabled-but-deeply-gated subnet and a disabled one both read final_share: 0 -- this flag is the only thing that separates them.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Boolean\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"final_share\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"gate_delta\",\"description\":\"gated_share - weighted_share. Sums to ~0 across the network: the gate redistributes, it never withholds.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"distance_to_bar\",\"description\":\"weighted_share / theta. Null when the bar is unset.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"tao_in_emission\",\"description\":\"Stage 8, measured: the TAO injected into the subnet's pool this block.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"excess_tao\",\"description\":\"Stage 7, measured: the TAO that reached the subnet by chain buys instead.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"tao_total\",\"description\":\"Their sum -- the subnet's whole TAO intake this block. Null unless both channels were actually read.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"liquidity_fraction\",\"description\":\"tao_in_emission / tao_total, the headline per-subnet number. Null rather than NaN for a zero-intake subnet: 0/0 is not a fraction, and zero intake is a real state.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"alpha_in_emission\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"alpha_out_emission\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"EmissionPipelineAggregate\",\"description\":\"Network-wide totals across every row in the capture -- unchanged by the netuid argument, which narrows the per-subnet rows only.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"eligible_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"disabled_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"tao_in_emission\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Float\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"excess_tao\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Float\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"tao_total\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Float\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"liquidity_fraction\",\"description\":\"The network split nobody else publishes: pool injection vs chain buys.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Float\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"total_final_share\",\"description\":\"Sum of final_share. 1.0 to float precision, or the surface is broken.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Float\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"EmissionPipelineVerification\",\"description\":\"The four identities, evaluated on the rows being served rather than read from a stored flag -- a stored flag can be green while THIS response is broken, and it can go stale. ADR 0023 decision 3.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"verified\",\"description\":\"False means at least one identity did not hold on these rows: the response is not defensible and must not be used.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Boolean\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"checks\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"LIST\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"EmissionIdentityCheck\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}}}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"subnet_share_tolerance\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Float\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"aggregate_tolerance_rao\",\"description\":\"A rao count as a string -- the tolerance is a bigint, and a JSON number is the wrong type for one.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"EmissionIdentityCheck\",\"description\":\"One identity, reported whether it passed or failed.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"name\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"ok\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Boolean\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"detail\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"RegistryLeaderboards\",\"description\":\"Registry leaderboards over the operational + economic-opportunity boards. Mirrors GET /api/v1/registry/leaderboards.\",\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"schema_version\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"board\",\"description\":\"The board filter that was applied, or null when every board is returned.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"observed_at\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"source\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"boards\",\"description\":\"Every board keyed by board name, each an array of ranked subnet entries capped at limit. Opaque JSON like HealthTrends.windows: the keys are dynamic AND hyphenated (fastest-rpc, most-complete, open-slots, …) so they are not expressible as GraphQL field names, and each board carries its own metric columns (healthiest has uptime_ratio/surfaces_ok, fastest-rpc has latency_ms, fastest-growing has completeness_delta, …). Passing it through verbatim keeps the REST/MCP get_registry_leaderboards shape byte-for-byte.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"JSON\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null,\"possibleTypes\":null},{\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"name\":\"SubnetMovers\",\"description\":null,\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"schema_version\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"window\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"start_date\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"end_date\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"String\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"covered_days\",\"description\":\"Days actually spanned between start_date and end_date. Null when either bound is unresolvable.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"requested_days\",\"description\":\"Days the requested window asked for (7, 30 or 90). Null when no window was resolved.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Int\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"window_truncated\",\"description\":\"True when covered_days is short of requested_days because the store does not reach back that far. It matters in ONE direction: every figure here is a DELTA between the window's endpoints, so a shortened span understates each change -- and the leaderboard is ORDERED by that understated delta, so truncation reorders it, not just shrinks it. NULL when the bounds could not be resolved at all, never false, which would assert a window nobody measured was complete.\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Boolean\",\"ofType\":null},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"sort\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"String\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"subnet_count\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"Int\",\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"network\",\"description\":\"Network-wide boundary totals for the movers window, summed across every ranked subnet (not just the returned page).\",\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"SubnetMoversNetwork\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null},{\"name\":\"movers\",\"description\":null,\"args\":[],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"name\":null,\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"LIST\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":null,\"kind\":\"NON_NULL\",\"ofType\":{\"name\":\"SubnetMover\",\"kind\":\"OBJECT\",\"ofType\":null}}}},\"isDeprecated\":false,\"deprecationReason\":null}],\"inputFields\":null,\"interfaces\":[],\"enumValues\":null